	(lib_symbols)
	(text "racebot_main - ESP32 + ELRS + 2x BTS7960B H-bridge main board (3S LiPo)\nPower nets: VMOT (switched, fused battery), +5V (LM2596), +3V3 (ESP32 board LDO), GND.\nLogic path: ESP32 GPIO (3.3 V) -> 74HCT244 (5 V) -> 10k -> BTS7960B IN/INH.\nCurrent sense: BTS IS -> 470R -> 1k/10nF -> BAT54S clamp -> ESP32 ADC1."
